  "body": "### What is the issue with the HTML Standard?\n\n[OrdinaryFunctionCreate](https://tc39.es/ecma262/#sec-ordinaryfunctioncreate) now has `env` and `privateEnv` arguments, but is called with a `scope` argument instead in [_getting the current value of the event handler_](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/webappapis.html#getting-the-current-value-of-the-event-handler).",
